{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_114_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_114","text":"辯中邊論校勘說明","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_114_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_114","text":"一．是書校歷二週．一譯校．二刻校。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_114_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_114","text":"二．譯校用二種異譯對校。（一）陳真諦譯中邊分別論．校註略稱陳本。（二）西藏勝","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_114_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_114","text":"友等譯辯中邊論釋．略稱藏本。","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_114_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_114","text":"三．異譯對校凡有四事。（一）品目．陳藏二本開合立名有異者．悉爲註出曰．某本不","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_114_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_114","text":"分品．或某本某品第幾。（二）章段．二本牒頌分段不同者．悉就頌文乙出。長行段","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_114_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_114","text":"落依頌而知．不別加註。（三）文句．二本具缺詳略互歧者．悉爲註出曰．某本雲雲。","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_114_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_114","text":"（四）意義．二本譯述較暢者．悉爲註出曰．勘某本雲雲。因此對校而見奘譯未愜","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_114_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_114","text":"者．幷加按語曰．今譯雲雲。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_114_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_114","text":"四．刻校用南宋刻爲底本．對校麗刻．訂正文字．附註曰．原雲雲．今依麗刻雲雲。又原","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_114_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_114","text":"刻頌文不標次第．今逐品逐頌用數字記明．以便檢索。","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_114_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_114","text":"五．是書對校所用陳本取日本大正大藏經本。藏本取曲尼版丹珠本dbus-dan%","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_114_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_114","text":"mtharnam-parh!byed-pah!ih!rel-pa（原本經解部bi字函一頁至二十七頁","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_114_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_114","text":"上。）至南宋刻麗刻則依日本弘教書院版正藏及大正大藏經之校註。","sortOrder":15}],"overrides":{}}